# Underlying benchmark data

The instances derive from the vrptdt-benchmark by Jannis Blauth, Stephan Held,
Dirk Müller, Niklas Schlomberg, Vera Traub, Thorben Tröbst and Jens Vygen
(University of Bonn). See LICENSE for the full attribution block.
